---
// /why/imu/: one-sentence takeaway that closes a section.
---
<p class="wt not-content"><span class="wt-k">Takeaway</span><slot /></p>

<style>
  .wt { display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; align-items: baseline; margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem; padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem; max-width: 46rem;
    border-radius: 0.6rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rp-mvis) 8%, var(--sl-color-bg)); color: var(--rp-ink); font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.45; }
  .wt-k { flex: none; font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--sl-color-accent); }
</style>
